{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o020e","title":"夏侯衡卒夏侯绩继嗣任中郎将后夏侯褒嗣","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o020e-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"夏侯衡卒夏侯绩继嗣任中郎将后夏侯褒嗣","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o020e-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xiahoucao-p0019","role":"死亡","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o020e-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0023","role":"嗣爵任官而卒","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o020e-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0024","role":"嗣爵","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o020e-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"夏侯渊死后至子孙嗣封","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o020e-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o020e-q","source_order":[9,86,"O020e"],"order":2159}],"persons":[{"id":"xiahoucao-p0024","name":"夏侯褒","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o020"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o020-xiahoucao-p0024","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o020"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o020e-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fa4c25b726867680170c","layer":"original","quote":"衡薨，子绩嗣，为虎贲中郎将。绩薨。子褒嗣。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":164,"end":185},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o020","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fa4c25b726867680170c","layer":"original","quote":"渊妻，太祖内妹〖12〗。长子衡，尚太祖弟海阳哀侯女，恩宠特隆。衡袭爵，转封安宁亭侯。黄初中，赐中子霸；太和中，赐霸四弟爵：皆关内侯。霸，正始中为讨蜀护军、右将军〖13〗，进封博昌亭侯。素为曹爽所厚，闻爽诛，自疑，亡入蜀。以渊旧勋，赦霸子，徙乐浪郡。﹝一﹞霸弟威，官至兖州刺史。﹝二﹞威弟惠，乐安太守。﹝三﹞惠弟和，河南尹。﹝四﹞衡薨，子绩嗣，为虎贲中郎将。绩薨。子褒嗣。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
